  "facts": [
    "The 15 July Martyrs Bridge, spanning 825 meters over the Seyhan River, was officially inaugurated on 28 April 2023 after its foundation stone was laid on 30 March 2016.",
    "With a width of 40 meters, the bridge carries three traffic lanes and a light railway line in each direction, designed to handle 55,000–60,000 vehicles daily.",
    "Budgeted at ₺120 million (about US$42.5 million in 2016), the bridge was commissioned by Adana’s Metropolitan Municipality and later transferred to the Central Government’s Ministry of Transportation."
